            "text": "Cichorium endivia is a species of flowering plant belonging to the genus Cichorium. It is widely cultivated as one of the species of similar bitter-leafed vegetables known as endive and escarole."
          },
          {
            "id": "s1:p2",
            "text": "There is considerable confusion between the species and C. intybus (common chicory)."
